sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Analyst as Security Officer / SOC
    participant UI as Web Interface
    participant Controller as AttackSurfaceScopeController
    participant Job as RunAttackSurfaceDiscovery Job
    participant Service as AttackSurfaceDiscoveryService
    participant Probe as SafeHostDiscoveryProbe / Subfinder
    participant DB as MariaDB

    Analyst->>UI: Start discovery for approved scope
    UI->>Controller: POST /attack-surface-scopes/{id}/run
    Controller->>Service: createRun(scope)
    Service->>DB: Persist AttackSurfaceRun (queued)
    Service-->>Controller: return run metadata
    Controller->>Job: dispatch(run id)
    Controller-->>UI: acknowledge queued discovery

    Job->>Service: executeRun(run)
    Service->>DB: Mark run as running
    Service->>Service: Resolve targets from scope type

    alt Domain expansion scope
        Service->>Probe: Enumerate subdomains with Subfinder
        Probe-->>Service: Resolved hostnames and IPs
    else CIDR / hostname / registered assets
        Service->>Service: Build target list directly
    end

    loop For each resolved target
        Service->>Probe: Probe target with TCP / ICMP strategy
        Probe-->>Service: Host status and open ports
        Service->>DB: Upsert DiscoveredHost

        opt Auto-create asset enabled
            Service->>DB: Create or link Asset
            Service->>DB: Register AssetLog
        end
    end

    Service->>DB: Mark run as completed / partial
    Service-->>Job: return run summary
    Job-->>UI: Discovery becomes available in UI
